# The platform binary is downloaded at install time by install.js. If a stale or
# locally built one is left in bin/, packing it would ship that architecture to
# every user, and `files: ["bin/"]` would include it. 0.19.0 shipped a baked-in
# Linux x64 binary for exactly this reason. The launcher only needs the JS.
bin/heides
bin/heides.exe
